; ==================== dsh-tray 配置文件模板 ====================
; 本文件可选:全部键留空(全部注释掉)= 全自动检测。
; 修改后保存,下次启动托盘生效。
;
; This file is optional: leave every key empty (all commented out)
; for full auto-detection. Changes take effect on the next start.
; ==========================================================

; Node.js 可执行文件路径(留空自动检测)
; Path to node.exe (empty = auto-detect)
;node=

; dsh 入口脚本路径(留空自动检测)
; Path to the dsh entry script (empty = auto-detect)
;dshentry=

; dsh 工作目录(留空自动推断)
; Working directory for dsh (empty = infer)
;dshworkdir=

; Chromium 系浏览器可执行文件(留空自动查找 Chrome / Edge)
; Chromium-family browser exe (empty = auto-detect Chrome / Edge)
;chrome=

; Harness 网页地址。端口由 url 自动推导(默认 3080),无需单独配置端口;
; 若需自定义端口,直接把 url 改成对应端口即可。
; Harness web URL. The port is derived from the URL (default 3080),
; so there is no separate port key; to use a custom port, just change the URL.
;url=

; 界面语言:zh / en(留空跟随系统)
; UI language: zh / en (empty = follow the system)
;lang=
